        "slc_f70c003835f384420cdf4d89ae0501227e8c3b12ced875d85052526c1cd3b266"
      ],
      "text": "Trust enforcement is opt-in via --enforce-folder-trust or OMC_ENFORCE_FOLDER_TRUST=1; trust states include trusted, sandbox-enforced, untrusted, and sandbox-unavailable, with mutation denied in the latter two."
    },
