        "slc_b7979b9b0ba6a83ec7369ad94ec3c6dee34174b822b8c3fc746d9b67ac325fdf"
      ],
      "text": "Compaction writes a versioned summary sidecar validated against the transcript digest before use, keeping completed tool actions as redacted receipts the resumed model is told not to repeat."
    },
