  "summary": "Selected evidence records: oh-my-cli is a small self-hosted code agent CLI that reads and edits files and runs shell commands under a safety plane, against any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. The project is built with Node.js 22, TypeScript, and ESM, and is installed via npm install/build/link or by running the built dist/index.js directly.",
